# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Address bans expire after ``services.stalwart.ban_period_seconds``** (one hour by default). Without a period Stalwart keeps a ban forever, and the reverse proxy, the published ports, Tor and the swarm ingress hand many clients one address."
