msgid "**Directory Profile:** `user_ldap` syncs phone, website, organisation, title, description, quota and avatar from the directory, and Nextcloud shows those profile fields read-only. [files/python/ldap_refresh.py](./files/python/ldap_refresh.py) runs `occ ldap:check-user --update` for every directory account Nextcloud already knows, as a host hook of [sys-ctl-mtn-rbac-sync](../sys-ctl-mtn-rbac-sync/) at every deploy and on its timer, so a profile changed in Keycloak arrives without a native LDAP login. The same hook composes street, postal code, city, region and country of the directory entry into the address and sets it with `occ user:profile`."
