# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Paths that look wrong and are not.** Policies mount at `/openbao/policies/`, because OpenBao parses *every* file under `-config` as server configuration. Storage is `/openbao/file`, not `/openbao/data`: the image pre-chowns only `/openbao/{config,logs,file}` for the non-root `openbao` user, so a volume elsewhere lands root-owned and raft cannot write. `command:` is just `server` — the entrypoint appends `-config` itself, and passing it duplicates the flag."
msgstr "**Yanlış baxmaq və deyil.** Sifarişlərin aparılması `/openbao/policies/`- OpenBao parses *haqqında* file `-config` server konfiqurasiyası kimi. Yadda saxla `/openbao/file`, deyil `/openbao/data`:: image pre-chowns `/openbao/{config,logs,file}` Qeyri-kökum `openbao` istifadəçi, belə ki, digər yerlər kök mövcud və raft yaza bilmir. `command:` Yalnız `server` — girişpoint appends `-config` özü, və qazanmaq bayrağı."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Paths that look wrong and are not.** Policies mount at ``/openbao/policies/``, because OpenBao parses *every* file under ``-config`` as server configuration. Storage is ``/openbao/file``, not ``/openbao/data``: the image pre-chowns only ``/openbao/{config,logs,file}`` for the non-root ``openbao`` user, so a volume elsewhere lands root-owned and raft cannot write. ``command:`` is just ``server`` — the entrypoint appends ``-config`` itself, and passing it duplicates the flag."
