msgid "**Prompt status:** a successful ``stop`` or ``start`` schedules one run of the webserver health sweep unit named by ``health_service``, ``health_delay_seconds`` after the last such action, through the transient timer ``app-control-health-refresh``; a later action moves the pending run behind it, so a resumed application answers before it is probed and bursts stay below the unit’s start limit. The dashboard’s badge follows one poll after that run. A host without the unit, such as a swarm node that runs no sweep, skips it, and a failure to schedule it is reported on stderr and in the exit code."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Prompt status:** a successful `stop` or `start` schedules one run of the webserver health sweep unit named by `health_service`, `health_delay_seconds` after the last such action, through the transient timer `app-control-health-refresh`; a later action moves the pending run behind it, so a resumed application answers before it is probed and bursts stay below the unit's start limit. The dashboard's badge follows one poll after that run. A host without the unit, such as a swarm node that runs no sweep, skips it, and a failure to schedule it is reported on stderr and in the exit code."
