msgid "**Read-only IdP fields:** every Keycloak login overwrites name, email and username. For an OAuth account Grafana renders the three profile fields disabled and refuses `PUT /api/user` and `PUT /api/users/:id` with HTTP 403 (`Cannot update external User`). The fields are declared in `services.sso.profile.locked`; the shared lock renderer of `sys-front-inj-javascript` adds the translated warning as their hover title in one of the UI languages listed in `services.sso.profile.languages`, and `files/playwright/test-profile-lock.js` proves both. The selectors match every disabled profile field, and Grafana also disables them for a local account while `native` is off; the break-glass account then has no UI session, because the login form is gone."
