msgid "**Runner.** Templates execute in a dedicated Semaphore runner container built on the Infinito.Nexus image, pinned to the image tag of the current deploy: CI passes its image tag through and never builds `latest`; production uses the release version. The runner holds no Docker socket, does not run as root, and reaches every host only over SSH with a key from the Semaphore key store."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Runs before the application role, in the dependency/service phase, once for all applications.** The `stack` service is loaded by `sys-service-loader` like the other shared services and processes every stack consumer of the play in one batch invocation. The application roles run afterwards and contain only application-specific configuration."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Runs only on change:** a hook registered with ``skip_unchanged`` runs when its definition or the members it receives changed since its last successful run, and at least once per ``RBAC_SYNC_REFRESH_SECONDS``."
msgstr ""

