# `css:` key `design:`. CSS enjeksiyonu tələb olunur `design` Yalnız.
# Anlaşdırma `design` həm öz JavaScript kanalını gətirir: rolun isteğe bağlı
# `templates/design.js.j2`, çökmüş, CSP-hashed və enjekte edilmiş
# `sys-front-inj-design`. `javascript:` key s s s (`javascript.js.j2`, SSO və
# logout yapışdırmaq ki, SSO olmadan işləmək lazımdır). `sys-front-inj-css` is
# `sys-front-inj-design` alüminium xüsusiyyət adları bir üçün bir
# `sys-front-inj-<feature>` rollar; `sys-front-inj-javascript` qaldırmaq.
msgid "**Service keys.** Consumers replace their `css:` key with `design:`. CSS injection is driven by `design` only. An enabled `design` always brings its own JavaScript channel: the role's optional `templates/design.js.j2`, collapsed, CSP-hashed and injected by `sys-front-inj-design`. The `javascript:` key stays independent and keeps gating the role's functional script (`javascript.js.j2`, which carries SSO and logout glue that must not run without SSO). `sys-front-inj-css` is renamed to `sys-front-inj-design` because injector feature names map one to one onto `sys-front-inj-<feature>` roles; `sys-front-inj-javascript` stays."
msgstr ""

