# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**The shared mechanism is extracted, not duplicated.** `Sampler`, `History`, `record_of`, `judge_answers` and `decide` move into one Python package owned by `svc-ai-s1`, which owns the decider contract, and staged into both `svc-ai-litellm` and `web-svc-translate` the way the MCP adapter's build context is staged per instance. The model router's behaviour MUST not change: its existing tests are the regression net for the extraction."
msgstr "**Paylaşılan mexaniya çıxarılır, lakin deyil.** `Sampler`, `History`, `record_of`, `judge_answers` and `decide` tərəfindən bir Python paketi daxil `svc-ai-s1`, Əməliyyatdan keçmiş və həmçinin həyata keçirilib `svc-ai-litellm` and `web-svc-translate` MCP adapterinin tikintisi konfransı mövcuddur. Model routerin davranışı MUST dəyişdirməz: onun mövcud sınaqlar ekstraksiya üçün regresyon netdir."

# `services.translate.router.strategy` follows `services.s1.enabled`: ağacaq
