msgid "**`scheduler`** — periodic-job dispatcher (`bench schedule`)"
msgstr "**`scheduler`** - ictimai-job təqdimçisi (`bench schedule`)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**`service_update_order = 'stop-first'`** is set in the role's compose template."
msgstr "**`service_update_order = 'stop-first'`** rolun nümayiş şablonunda əsaslanır."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**`shared_engine_isolation` (4):** `svc-db-memcached`, `svc-db-openldap`, `svc-db-postgres`, `svc-db-rabbitmq`. A generic endpoint would bypass application and tenant authorization on a shared engine. Any future exception requires a provider-application-specific account, namespace/database/schema/queue restriction, fixed named operations, and no engine administrator credential."
msgstr "**`shared_engine_isolation` (4):** `svc-db-memcached`, `svc-db-openldap`, `svc-db-postgres`, `svc-db-rabbitmq`. Bir ümumi sonpoint paylaşılan motorda tətbiq və onant saxlamaq olardı. Heç bir fəaliyyət müştəri-application-a xüsusi hesab edir, namespace/database/schema/queue Əməliyyat, sabit adı əməliyyatları və heç bir mühüm meneceri credential."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**`socketio`** — Node real-time WebSocket service"
msgstr "**`socketio`** - Node real-time WebSocket xidmət"

msgid "**`sso`:** `enable-login-with-oidc` (the in-app \"OpenID\" entry to [`web-app-keycloak`](../web-app-keycloak/)) together with `enable-oidc-registration`, so a first OIDC login creates its Penpot profile while local self-registration stays closed."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**`svc-ai-litellm` is headless and internal-only; the admin UI is a separate optional `web-app-litellm` role.** The gateway itself exposes no public domain and no LiteLLM admin UI. A distinct `web-app-litellm` role serves the admin interface behind the proxy with SSO, following the standard `web-app-*` contract. Coupling is asymmetric: `web-app-litellm` REQUIRES the gateway (deploying it forces `svc-ai-litellm` to `enabled: true` + `shared: true`), while `svc-ai-litellm` only OPTIONALLY references the UI (via `group_names`) and runs fine without it."
msgstr "**`svc-ai-litellm` başsız və daxili; admin UI ayrı bir isteğe bağlı `web-app-litellm` rol** Gateway özü ictimai domen yoxdur və LiteLLM admin UI. Axtarış `web-app-litellm` rol SSO ilə proxy arxasında admin interfeys edir, standart aşağıdakı `web-app-*` contract. Coupling asimmetrikdir: `web-app-litellm` Qeydiyyat (Bu qurğular `svc-ai-litellm` Oxunub `enabled: true` + `shared: true`), `svc-ai-litellm` Qeydiyyatdan keçirilmişdir (vaxt `group_names`) və bu olmadan gözəl çalışır."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**`svc-ai-ollama` stays the default local backend behind the gateway.** No new model-serving stack replaces it; it is registered as a `model_list` entry."
msgstr "**`svc-ai-ollama` ağacaq ağacaq.** No yeni model-serving yığın onu dəyişdirir; Bu qeydiyyatdan keçmişdir `model_list` giriş."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**`svc-ai-robot` deploys Hermes in embodied mode on a dedicated device.** It reuses the `web-app-hermes` agent from [032](032-agent-employees-firecracker.md) and configures it for privileged hardware access. The trust boundary is the device ([032](032-agent-employees-firecracker.md) Decision #12), so no microVM wraps the agent here."
