msgid "The wiki's bureaucrat and sysop is the platform administrator's account, which `files/shell/realign_admin_password.sh` in `tasks/04_admin.yml` creates through `maintenance/run.php createAndPromote` only while local login is on. With `sso` on, `$wgPluggableAuth_EnableLocalLogin` is false, the script sends no password and leaves a missing account to its first OIDC login, which `$wgOpenIDConnect_MigrateUsersByUserName` links to an existing account of the same name. The script promotes an existing account that is no sysop to sysop and bureaucrat only while local login is off and its email, which PluggableAuth confirms when it creates the account, equals `MEDIAWIKI_ADMINISTRATOR_EMAIL`; otherwise the deploy fails and names the reason (local login on, email differs, email unconfirmed). `files/playwright/test-rbac-groups.js` asserts the group sync: it adds biber to each role group, signs in through Keycloak, reads the wiki groups from `Special:ListUsers`, then removes the membership and asserts the next login revokes them. It also signs the administrator in and asserts the session belongs to the provisioned account and holds `sysop`, `bureaucrat` and `interface-admin`. `files/playwright/test-profile-sync.js` sets `locale` and `zoneinfo` on biber in Keycloak, signs in, and asserts the interface language, the disabled preference fields on `Special:Preferences` and the saved `language` and `timecorrection` options."
msgstr ""

msgid "The wiki’s bureaucrat and sysop is the platform administrator’s account, which ``files/shell/realign_admin_password.sh`` in ``tasks/04_admin.yml`` creates through ``maintenance/run.php createAndPromote`` only while local login is on. With ``sso`` on, ``$wgPluggableAuth_EnableLocalLogin`` is false, the script sends no password and leaves a missing account to its first OIDC login, which ``$wgOpenIDConnect_MigrateUsersByUserName`` links to an existing account of the same name. The script promotes an existing account that is no sysop to sysop and bureaucrat only while local login is off and its email, which PluggableAuth confirms when it creates the account, equals ``MEDIAWIKI_ADMINISTRATOR_EMAIL``; otherwise the deploy fails and names the reason (local login on, email differs, email unconfirmed). ``files/playwright/test-rbac-groups.js`` asserts the group sync: it adds biber to each role group, signs in through Keycloak, reads the wiki groups from ``Special:ListUsers``, then removes the membership and asserts the next login revokes them. It also signs the administrator in and asserts the session belongs to the provisioned account and holds ``sysop``, ``bureaucrat`` and ``interface-admin``. ``files/playwright/test-profile-sync.js`` sets ``locale`` and ``zoneinfo`` on biber in Keycloak, signs in, and asserts the interface language, the disabled preference fields on ``Special:Preferences`` and the saved ``language`` and ``timecorrection`` options."
msgstr ""

