# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "This role is a generic GNOME-extension installer driven by ``services.gnome-extensions.plugins``, a 3-tuple list (``action``, ``uuid``, ``url``) consumed by ``cli-gnome-extension-manager``. It ships no concrete extensions of its own and reads no ``meta/addons/`` files. Roles that ship concrete GNOME extensions, such as `dsk-gnome <../dsk-gnome/>`__, declare them through the unified addon contract under ``meta/addons/`` (requirement 026), with one file per extension (``mechanism: extension``, ``source: upstream``, ``config: { uuid, url }``); see that role for the per-file example."
msgstr "Bu rol, tərəfindən idarə olunan ümumi GNOME-exzip installer ``services.gnome-extensions.plugins``, Axtar 3- (``action``, ``uuid``, ``url``) Yapon ``cli-gnome-extension-manager``. O, öz beton uzantıları hesab edir və heç bir hesab edir ``meta/addons/`` fayllar. Dövlət GNOME uzantıları daxil olan rollar, kimi `dsk-gnome <../dsk-gnome/>`__, Əgər birləşmiş əlavə vasitəsi ilə onları hesab edin ``meta/addons/`` (requirement 026)bir fayl üçün bir fayl (``mechanism: extension``, ``source: upstream``, ``config: { uuid, url }``); per-file səs üçün rol gör."

