msgstr ""

msgid "`#scheduled` and `#rescheduled` become `CONFIRMED`, `#planned` and `#postponed` become `TENTATIVE`, `#cancelled` becomes `CANCELLED`. A missing status is the lexicon default `#scheduled`; an unknown value stops the record from being mirrored."
